	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Christus, dominus et salvator noster faxit, ut hic annus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>tibi omnibusque tuis felicibus ineat auspiciis, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>exeat longe felicissime!</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tuae literae <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>mihi sunt redditae, frater dilecte, ex quibus intelligo <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>multa apud vos perinde ut apud nos spargi <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>mendatia.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ego iam diebus aliquot nullas <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>accepi literas neque <placeName ref="l167">Geneva</placeName> neque <placeName ref="l41">Berna</placeName> neque <lb xml:id="p1z8"/><placeName ref="l339">Neocomo</placeName> aut <placeName ref="l49">Bienna</placeName>; silent omnia pertinacis<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>sime.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Proinde de rebus <placeName ref="l832">Galliae</placeName>, quod inde scribam, non <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>habeo.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Caete<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>rum quae <placeName ref="l361">Neroberga</placeName>* <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ad me missa sunt per virum praestantissimum in char<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tam coniecta tibi communico<note type="margin">dazu a.R. m. Verweisg. v. <persName ref="p4679">Egli</persName> bem.: "Illis novis confirmantur maxime quae alteris d. <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>i literis de clade <placeName>Albana</placeName> scribuntur."</note> confirmantur haec et <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>aliis literis aliunde allatis; verum claudicantem, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>quod dici solet, nuncium expectabimus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Tu dominis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>consulibus<note type="margin">a.R.: cosss.</note>, d. <persName>Carolo</persName>, <persName ref="p20473">Ganthnero</persName>, <persName ref="p6130">Pontisellae</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>omnia mea officia offeres, quibus precor annum hunc <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>felicissimum.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Si quid ad me fuerit perlatum<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>, alias communicabo fidelissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Iam <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>vale una cum bonis omnibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Tristis hic <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>allata est fama ad cataractas <placeName ref="l2459">Rheni</placeName> mortuum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>esse filium d. <persName ref="p2043">Ambrosi Martini</persName> consulis, qui non <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ita pridem duxerat in uxorem filiam <persName>Stuckii</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>qui in arce ad cataractas <placeName ref="l2459">Rheni</placeName> (im <placeName ref="l2581">Louffen</placeName>) <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>praefectus est; apud socerum ergo mortuum aiunt.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Nollem tamen t id me indice spargere; si <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>verum est, nunciabitur parenti a socero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Iterum iterumque vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> ultima decembris <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>a<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>nno a Christo nato 1569.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Diewyl es also gar still ist, achten ich, der <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>haffenplatsch werde sich bald mitt ein<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>andren ußschütten.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ornatissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8016">Tobiae <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Eglio</persName>, fideli ministro <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName>, domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>colendo et fratri <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>dilecto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Chur.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
